      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that looks okay, but honestly, mentioning that \"25% increase\" in the executive summary might cause unnecessary panic with the Board. they're already looking for reasons to cut costs, and seeing a spike like that in Engineering might make them think we have a huge management problem.\n\ncan you rewrite it to be a bit smoother? maybe just frame the turnover generally across the org or focus on the departments that are doing well? i want to present a unified picture of stability without drawing a giant red circle around the engineering numbers. just make it sound like everything is pretty much on track.",
